{"id":"beabf1d3-ee7e-4d27-92b1-039290c217dc","slug":"ig30ht","model":"IG30HT","name":"IG30HT 高量程浊度传感器","shortDescription":"采用红外散射光原理测量浊度，适用于工业过程水、地表水及水处理监测。数字探头结合光学补偿与蓝宝石视窗，可选自动清洁刷，减少持续运行中的表面附着。","featured":false,"category":{"slug":"water","brand":null,"name":"水质分析","description":null,"seo":{"title":"水质分析","description":null,"imageUrl":null,"index":true}},"heroImage":{"id":"95eccf83-22e5-4f4d-a03f-5509479d7661","kind":"IMAGE","originalName":"2025040860985293.jpg","mimeType":"image/png","size":11246,"sha256":"ecdac2d963d6479b136774a8172895d54061650f1cb8089d1404ff2a26710a79","width":190,"height":78,"url":"/igenu-preview/media/ecdac2d963d6479b136774a8.png","createdAt":"2026-10-20T17:32:39.787Z","variants":[{"width":190,"height":78,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/c0547cb002a63d36b1ac374c.webp"}]},"detailLayout":"STRUCTURED","availableLocales":["zh-CN","de","en"],"description":null,"bodyHtml":"<p><strong><span>产品特点：</span></strong></p><p>◆内置温度传感器，自动光源温飘补偿 </p><p>◆采用双光束红外和散射光光度计检测技术 ，具有良好的重复性及稳定性</p><p>◆数字传感器，RS-485输出，标准ModbusRTU协议，不受传输距离影响，稳定性更佳 </p><p>◆传感器采用不锈钢材料，使用寿命更长，降低维护与停机时间 </p><p>◆使用860nm近红外光源，可补偿样品背景光颜色干扰</p><p>◆具备自清洗系统，运行稳定、维护量小 </p><p>◆蓝宝石视窗，经久耐磨，保障长期数据准确性</p><p>◆不受流速干扰、能承受剧烈冲击</p><p>◆数字化传感器，抗干扰能力强，传输距离远</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>应用领域：</span></strong></p><p>工业过程用水监测、饮用水处理、地表水/地下水监测、污水处理、膜过滤监测</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>技术参数：</span></strong></p><p>量程：0~1000NTU，0.2~4000NTU，0.5~10000NTU</p><p>测量原理：860nm 波长，90°和 135°散射光 </p><p>分辨率：0.001 NTU </p><p>测量精度：读数的±1%或±0.1NTU，取大者</p><p>重复性：小于±1% </p><p>气泡补偿：以软件为基础的气泡补偿 </p><p>响应时间：T90＜5S</p><p>最大压力：≤30bar </p><p>校准方式：单点样品、斜率校准 </p><p>传感器材质：机身：SUS316L；视窗：蓝宝石</p><p>自清洗：自动刮刷（可不选） </p><p>光衰补偿：自动</p><p>传感器通讯：MODBUS RS-485 </p><p>存储温度：-10~50℃ </p><p>工作温度：0~45℃（不结冰） </p><p>防护等级：IP68 </p><p>线缆长度：标准10m，可延长</p><p>最大压力：30bar</p><p>最大流速：3米/秒</p><p>传感器尺寸： 176mm*22mm</p><br />\n    ","gallery":[],"features":[],"specificationGroups":[{"name":"技术参数","specifications":[{"key":"measurement-range","label":"量程","value":"0~1000NTU，0.2~4000NTU，0.5~10000NTU","unit":null},{"key":"measurement-principle","label":"测量原理","value":"860nm 波长，90°和 135°散射光","unit":null},{"key":"resolution","label":"分辨率","value":"0.001 NTU","unit":null},{"key":"accuracy","label":"测量精度","value":"读数的±1%或±0.1NTU，取大者","unit":null},{"key":"repeatability","label":"重复性","value":"小于±1%","unit":null},{"key":"bubble-compensation","label":"气泡补偿","value":"以软件为基础的气泡补偿","unit":null},{"key":"response-time","label":"响应时间","value":"T90＜5S","unit":null},{"key":"maximum-pressure","label":"最大压力","value":"≤30bar; 30bar","unit":null},{"key":"calibration","label":"校准方式","value":"单点样品、斜率校准","unit":null},{"key":"sensor-material","label":"传感器材质","value":"机身：SUS316L；视窗：蓝宝石","unit":null},{"key":"self-cleaning","label":"自清洗","value":"自动刮刷（可不选）","unit":null},{"key":"light-attenuation-compensation","label":"光衰补偿","value":"自动","unit":null},{"key":"digital-communication","label":"传感器通讯","value":"MODBUS RS-485","unit":null},{"key":"storage-temperature","label":"存储温度","value":"-10~50℃","unit":null},{"key":"operating-temperature","label":"工作温度","value":"0~45℃（不结冰）","unit":null},{"key":"protection","label":"防护等级","value":"IP68","unit":null},{"key":"cable","label":"线缆长度","value":"标准10m，可延长","unit":null},{"key":"maximum-flow","label":"最大流速","value":"3米/秒","unit":null},{"key":"sensor-size","label":"传感器尺寸","value":"176mm*22mm","unit":null}]}],"sourceReviews":[],"documents":[],"supportDownloads":[],"seo":{"title":"IG30HT 高量程浊度传感器 | IGENU SCIENCE","description":"采用红外散射光原理测量浊度，适用于工业过程水、地表水及水处理监测。数字探头结合光学补偿与蓝宝石视窗，可选自动清洁刷，减少持续运行中的表面附着。","imageUrl":"/igenu-preview/media/ecdac2d963d6479b136774a8.png","index":true}}